            <section class="spread t-hero-plus-stack"
             data-spread="location"><h2>geographic location</h2><div class="prose-slot" lang="en"><p>Nairobi is situated at 1°09′S 36°39′E&#xfeff; / &#xfeff;1.150°S 36.650°E&#xfeff; / -1.150; 36.650&#xfeff; (Nairobi, Kenya) and 1°27′S 37°06′E&#xfeff; / &#xfeff;1.450°S 37.100°E&#xfeff; / -1.450; 37.100&#xfeff; (Nairobi, Kenya) and occupies 696 square kilometres (270&#160;sq&#160;mi).</p><a class="read" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nairobi#Geography">Geography ↗</a></div><div data-slot="hero">
